  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support a Widow &amp; Her Disabled Children in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support a poor widow, to take good care of herself and her 3 disabled children. Mrs Faith is a mother of nine children and about 7 years ago, the last three of her children who use to be healthy, a boy of 21 years plus two girls of 23 and 19 years respectively, suddenly became disabled within a year. This woman has no source of livelihood, stays home to take care of these children and relies on the support from people in doing so. Please refer to the photos section for more.</narrative>
  </description>
